"/docs/server/build#run-the-tests","content":"Other useful labels are `protocol`, `conformance`, `calibration`, `setup`,\n`nvenc`, `gpu` and `telemetry`. List all tests with\n`ctest --test-dir build/dev-debug -N`."},"1642":{"id":"/docs/server/build-103","page_id":"/docs/server/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/build#tests-with-special-needs","content":"**Hardware tests** (label `hardware`) need Orbbec cameras. The\n`orbbec_live_sync_integration_test` opens the cameras by the serial numbers\nin `config/dev/live.yaml`. Edit that file to match your cameras (see\nConfiguration). `nvenc_hevc_round_trip_integration_test`\nalso has this label but needs only a GPU with NVENC. It decodes with the GPU when it can and falls back to FFmpeg software decoding."},"1643":{"id":"/docs/server/build-104","page_id":"/docs/server/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/build#tests-with-special-needs","content":"**RVM smoke tests** (`smoke_rvm_engine_b1` and `smoke_rvm_engine_b2`, label\n`rvm`) need the engines in `models/rvm/generated/` (see\nInstall). Without them, CTest\nreports the two tests as `Not Run` and the run counts as failed. This does\nnot mean the code is broken."},"1644":{"id":"/docs/server/build-105","page_id":"/docs/server/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/build#tests-with-special-needs","content":"**Protocol conformance** (`protocol_conformance_tests`) reads the contract\nand test vectors from `../protocol`. If the contract lives elsewhere, set the\nCMake cache variable when you configure, with `<path>` replaced by the\nfolder that contains `wire-format.md`, `schema/` and `vectors/`:\n`cmake --preset dev-debug -DORBBEC_STREAMER_PROTOCOL_CONTRACT_DIR=<path>`."},"1645":{"id":"/docs/server/build-106","page_id":"/docs/server/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/build#smoke-tests-by-hand","content":"`orbbec_streamer` has built-in smoke tests. Each flag runs one check and exits:"},"1646":{"id":"/docs/server/build-107"