","page_id":"/docs/server/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/install#tensorrt","content":"`libnvinfer-bin` provides `trtexec`, which only the RVM engine build needs."},"2964":{"id":"/docs/server/install-50","page_id":"/docs/server/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/install#tensorrt","content":"The tested version is TensorRT `11.1.0.106-1+cuda13.3`. Plain `tensorrt-dev`\ninstalls the newest build, currently `11.3.0.99-1+cuda13.4`, which targets\nCUDA 13.4 and is not tested. The repository also has `11.2.1.2-1+cuda13.3`,\nwhich targets the tested CUDA 13.3 but is itself not tested. To stay on the tested stack, see\nTroubleshooting."},"2965":{"id":"/docs/server/install-51","page_id":"/docs/server/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/install#tensorrt","content":"For a TensorRT tar archive instead of the Debian packages, point CMake at it\nbefore you configure (replace the path with your extracted folder):"},"2966":{"id":"/docs/server/install-52","page_id":"/docs/server/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/install#orbbec-sdk","content":"Install Orbbec SDK 2.8.7 from its GitHub release:"},"2967":{"id":"/docs/server/install-53","page_id":"/docs/server/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/install#orbbec-sdk","content":"The package installs to `/opt/OrbbecSDK_v2.8.7`. Its install script then:"},"2968":{"id":"/docs/server/install-54","page_id":"/docs/server/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/install#orbbec-sdk","content":"copies the libraries and `OrbbecSDKConfig.cmake` to `/usr/local/lib`, where\nthe presets look for them (`OrbbecSDK_DIR=/usr/local/lib`)"},"2969":{"id":"/docs/server/install-55","page_id":"/docs/server/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/install#orbbec-sdk","content":"copies the headers to `/usr/local/include/libobsensor`"},"2970":{"id":"/docs/server/install-56","page_id":"/docs/server/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/inst