gs":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"146.8 ms"},"3872":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-196","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"`sdk_internal`"},"3873":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-197","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"8.7–10.5 ms"},"3874":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-198","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"12.8–14.9 ms"},"3875":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-199","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"`align`"},"3876":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-200","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"2.5–4.1 ms"},"3877":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-201","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"6.3–7.6 ms"},"3878":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-202","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"`arrival_skew` = `batch_wait`"},"3879":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-203","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"2.8–4.3 ms"},"3880":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-204","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"15–16 ms"},"3881":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-205","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"`upload_queue` + `upload_submit`"},"3882":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-206","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"0.6–0.8 ms"},"3883":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-207","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"1.7–2.0 ms"},"3884":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-208","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"`processing` (fill_all mask + bilateral filter)"},"3885":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-209","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"0.25–0.48 ms"},"3886":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-210","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"1.0–1.2 ms"},"3887":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-211","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"`side_path` (no preview)"},"3888":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-212","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"\\< 0.01 ms"},"3889":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-213","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"\\< 0.01 ms"},"3890":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-214","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"`encode_bundle` (both access units out)"},"3891":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-215","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"1.9–2.4 ms"},"3892":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-216","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"3.5–4.2 ms"},"3893":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-217","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"`sdk->handoff`"},"3894":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-218","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"5.4–7.7 ms"},"3895":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-219","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"11.5–12.3 ms"},"3896":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-220","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"`capture->handoff`"},"3897":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-221","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"155–159 ms"},"3898":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-222","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"168–172 ms"},"3899":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-223","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"Also healthy: every `LIVE PIPELINE` row at the configured fps (`encode` at\ncameras × fps), all `dropped` counters at 0, both cameras at the same\n`frame_sets/s`, and equal `captured`, `uploaded` and `processed` totals in the\nsummary. With debug recording on the numbers are the same and nothing drops."},"3900":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-224","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#what-good-looks-like","content":"How to read it: the server code adds about 6–8 ms at p50 and about 12 ms at\np99 (`sdk->handoff`). About 140 ms of the 155 ms happen before the SDK\ndelivers the frames: colour arrives about 40 ms after depth, and the SDK's\n`rgb8` conversion takes about 10 ms. At 30 fps the camera side is about\n65 ms shorter. RVM segmentation, when enabled, adds to `processing`; it was\nnot part of this baseline."},"3901":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-225","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Symptom"},"3902":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-226","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Likely cause"},"3903":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-227","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"What to do"},"3904":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-228","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"`upload` `dropped` rising"},"3905":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-229","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Capture outpaces the upload thread: CPU overload or slow pinned-memory copies. `upload_submit` is high."},"3906":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-230","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Check host load; close other heavy processes; use the `dev-relwithdebinfo` build."},"3907":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-231","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"`process` `dropped` rising, `processing` p99 near the frame interval (66.7 ms at 15 fps)"},"3908":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-232","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"GPU processing too slow, usually RVM or a large bilateral radius."},"3909":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-233","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Check the RVM engine matches the camera count and resolution; lower `processing.bilateral_maximum_radius_pixels`; try `mask.backend: fill_all` to confirm."},"3910":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-234","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"`encode` `dropped` rising, `encode_queue` growing"},"3911":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-235","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"NVENC cannot keep up, or another process uses the encoder."},"3912":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-236","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Check `nvidia-smi --query-gpu=encoder.stats.sessionCount,utilization.encoder --format=csv`; stop other encoders; lower resolution or fps. A larger `encoding.queue_capacity` only adds latency."},"3913":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-237","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"`upload slots exhausted` warnings"},"3914":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-238","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"A stage or a debug recorder holds GPU batches longer than the queues allow for."},"3915":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-239","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Report it with the log: the slot count is sized for the configured queues, so this points at a bug. The server keeps running and counts the drops."},"3916":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-240","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"`encode_color` or `encode_bundle` max around 30–35 ms, p99 normal"},"3917":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-241","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Isolated slow encodes; the baseline runs show them too."},"3918":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-242","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Nothing, unless p99 rises too."},"3919":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-243","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"`capture` fps below the configured rate while each camera's `frame_sets/s` is correct"},"3920":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-244","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Batches do not form: camera timestamps are further apart than `sync.timestamp_tolerance_us`."},"3921":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-245","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Check the sync cable and roles; run `--orbbec-live-sync-test` (it reports skew); power-cycle the cameras."},"3922":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-246","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"One camera's `frame_sets/s` lower than the other's"},"3923":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-247","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"USB bandwidth, a bad cable, or the camera is not triggered."},"3924":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-248","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Move the camera to another USB controller; check the sync cable."},"3925":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-249","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"`arrival_skew` / `batch_wait` p99 well above \\~16 ms"},"3926":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-250","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"The two cameras' capture threads are delivering at different times, often because of CPU load (alignment runs on the CPU per camera)."},"3927":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-251","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Reduce host load. A value near one frame interval means the cameras are out of sync; see the row above."},"3928":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-252","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"`sdk->handoff` p99 far above \\~12 ms, with no single large stage"},"3929":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-253","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"CPU contention: queues and threads wait for the scheduler."},"3930":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-254","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Check host load (`uptime`); compare with a quiet machine."},"3931":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-255","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"`side_path` above 1 ms"},"3932":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-256","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"The processing thread is being descheduled (CPU contention). A slow preview window cannot cause this: it runs on its own thread."},"3933":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-257","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Check host load (`uptime`)."},"3934":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-258","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"`drops(in/out)` rising in `DEBUG RECORDING RATES`, or `worker=failed`"},"3935":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-259","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"The recorder (disk, FFV1 encode or local decode) cannot keep up, or failed. The pipeline is unaffected."},"3936":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-260","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Record fewer cameras (`debug_recording.camera_ids`), turn off `locally_decode_gpu_outputs`, or write to a faster disk."},"3937":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-261","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Rate tables appear but no latency reports"},"3938":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-262","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"The in-place display overwrote them."},"3939":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-263","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Set `ORBBEC_STREAMER_STATUS_MODE=log`."},"3940":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-264","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"No rate tables for the first seconds"},"3941":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-265","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Normal: rates are hidden for 5 s after start so start-up does not distort them."},"3942":{"id":"/docs/server/telemetry-266","page_id":"/docs/server/telemetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/server/telemetry#troubleshooting","content":"Wait."},"3943":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","type":"page","content":"Troubleshooting & FAQ","breadcrumbs":["HSLU OrbbecStreamer"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq"},"3944":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-0","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","content":"Cross-team questions and where to find every build and run failure."},"3945":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-1","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#setting-up","content":"Setting up"},"3946":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-2","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#faq","content":"FAQ"},"3947":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-3","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#setting-up","content":"Every build and run error, with its cause and fix, lives with the step it\nbelongs to:"},"3948":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-4","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#setting-up","content":"Requirements: driver, CUDA and USB issues, including a GPU older than compute capability 8.9."},"3949":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-5","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#setting-up","content":"Install: packages, TensorRT, the Orbbec SDK and the RVM engine."},"3950":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-6","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#setting-up","content":"Build and test: CMake configure, compiler mismatches and CTest."},"3951":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-7","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#setting-up","content":"Configuration: every live config validation error."},"3952":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-8","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#setting-up","content":"Run the server: start-up and runtime failures."},"3953":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-9","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#setting-up","content":"Run the dev build: the client's dev server and build."},"3954":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-10","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#faq","content":"**Can I see my own camera in the browser today?** Not yet. WebTransport\nserving is not implemented (see Serve to browsers),\nso a browser cannot connect to a real server. Run\nFirst stream on the server instead;\noptionally preview a hand-built recording in the client (see\nPlay back .hevc recordings)."},"3955":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-11","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#faq","content":"**Do I need the RVM segmentation model to get a first stream?** No.\n`mask.backend: \"fill_all\"` treats the whole frame as foreground and needs no\nmodel or engine file. Building the RVM engine is a separate, optional step;\nsee Install."},"3956":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-12","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#faq","content":"**Is a missing `camera-pose.json` a problem?** No. The server starts in\n“needs setup” and keeps capturing, processing and encoding normally. See\nStartup states."},"3957":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-13","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#faq","content":"**Why can't I calibrate on the server and commit from the client?** The\nserver and client cannot connect to each other yet. See\nCalibration for what each side can do on its\nown."},"3958":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq-14","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-faq#faq","content":"**Where do I ask about protocol or wire-format questions?**\n`protocol/wire-format.md` is the normative contract; cross-team changes go\nthrough `protocol/changes/` (see the repository root `CLAUDE.md`)."}},"count":3958},"s